# generated files
#
# Only the TEST-ONLY generated files stay untracked. Everything the library
# build needs is COMMITTED, so a consumer that resolves status-go as a nimble
# dependency gets a buildable tree and needs no generator toolchain. See
# docs/building.md, "Generated Go sources are committed".
mock/
mock.go
*_mock_test.go

# A checkout build with the default STATUSGO_BUILD_DIR writes its nim-sds
# artifacts here.
/.sds-build/

go.work
go.work.sum

# Token deployment cache files
test/functional/snt_addresses.json*

# libstorage
libs

